The compensations, in section and in grams at the button (hole 20 × 15 mm, r = 1). Reference: on the draw, pressure clamps the pallet. (a) A small pilot pallet opened first. (b) Two pallets side by side. (c) A balanced pallet: two seats on one stem. (d) A helper spring at the button. (e) Lift-off, mid-stroke and return at the button.
\end_layout

